  "description": "Images and Words is the second studio album by American progressive metal band Dream Theater, released on July 7, 1992, through Atco Records. It is the first Dream Theater release to feature James LaBrie on vocals. Since its release, the album has maintained its position as the band's most commercially successful studio album, and the song \"Pull Me Under\" has the distinction of being the only Top 10 hit the band has had to date. This particular song also had renewed popularity due to its appearance in the 2008 video game Guitar Hero World Tour.",
